    Title a chat from the user's own words

    The title request sent the user's first message together with the whole
    first reply, including empty assistant turns left by tool calls, and asked
    for "the user's language". gpt-5.4-mini titled an English chat in Chinese
    in 4 of 6 runs of that request. Sending only the user's first written
    message, and asking for the language the user writes in, gave English in
    32 of 32 runs while Chinese and German messages kept their language.
